# drizzle-kit generate produces a full-snapshot migration and meta/ directory
# when run against a hand-written SQL migration folder. These are artefacts
# of the generate run used to verify the schema is correct; they are not
# part of the migration history and must not be committed.
meta/
# Generated snapshot migrations (named by drizzle-kit, not following our
# 000N_<description>.sql convention) are also excluded.
0000_special_unus.sql
